  .container
    .about-us
      .about-us_content
        h2.about-us_title.title-3 About Us
        //- h2.about-us_title.title-3 About Us
        p.about-us_text We are a reliable wholesale supplier of a wide range of 
                      | stationery for office and study. We guarantee the highest 
                      | quality of every item thanks to our collaboration with trusted 
                      | manufacturers and our own production. Our goal is to provide 
                      | you with the best stationery.
        p.about-us_text Every stage of the arrival of goods at our warehouse undergoes 
                      | strict inspection, which guarantees the reliability and durability 
                      | of the products. You can explore our assortment in the "Catalog". 
                      | We offer flexible cooperation terms and accept orders starting from 
                      | one pallet.
        p.about-us_text Our company offers private label development services, including 
                      | design and packaging, which will favorably distinguish your brand and 
                      | increase customer loyalty. By choosing us, you receive high-quality 
                      | stationery and stylish branding. We provide worldwide delivery and 
                      | invite you to long-term partnership.
      .about-us_img-box
        img.about-us_img-body(src='@img/about-us.jpeg')
